detaileddescription.para:
Following pattern: if(idx<tablesize)
r=table[idx];//tabledoesnotcontaindefault_value
else
r=default_value;
if(r!=default_value)
...
 Is optimized to: cond=idx<tablesize;
if(cond)
r=table[idx];
else
r=default_value;
if(cond)
...
 Jump threading will then eliminate the second if(cond).
